/*
 * Shared test fixture — not shipped in any package.
 *
 * Ground truth for the engineering mechanics, cost, journal-collision and decorative
 * catalogues under data/ships/: the per-grade modifier legs and material recipes a blueprint
 * applies, each experimental effect's modifiers and one-application cost, the three decorative
 * transformations, the journal spellings that collide, and the engineered results those fold to.
 */
